Output "demos/shop/takes/v3-shop-take.mp4"
Set Shell bash
Set FontFamily "Menlo"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 2200
Set Height 1500
Set Padding 8
Set Framerate 30
Hide
Type "bursar"
Enter
Wait+Screen@90s /I am ready\./
Sleep 300ms
Show
Type "a buyer will pay 0.15 USDC on Solana"
Enter
Wait+Screen@120s /bursar-code\.png/
Sleep 3s
